  "content": "\n\n<h1>突破极限!!!!!!本模组全面重制了《<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">拔刀剑：重锋</span></a></strong>》的战斗机制，将武器性能推向超越传统平衡的极致！！！</h1>\n<h2>本模组引入的所有更改均可通过配置文件进行调整，玩家可自行开启或关闭各项功能。</h2>\n<h2>当前特性：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>索敌开关按键：关闭索敌后，潜行键将不再锁定目标。</li>\n<li>延长准星索敌范围：指哪打哪，精准锁定。</li>\n<li>准星索敌辅助：再也不用担心锁不到目标。</li>\n<li>扩大范围索敌：“蜘蛛感应”覆盖更广的威胁检测范围。</li>\n<li>可配置索敌转向速度：自定义索敌时视角旋转的速度。</li>\n<li>空中闪避：在空中规避攻击。</li>\n<li>连招打断按键：瞬间脱离连招状态。</li>\n<li>可配置缓降效果：自由掌控下落速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">所有功能均支持服务端配置。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>如有建议或发现Bug，请：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题反馈 · Arcomit/surpass</a></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>或</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">合并请求 · Arcomit/surpass</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>GitHub：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcomit/surpass: 超越限制，重锋附属</a></span></strong><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>许可证：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass?tab=GPL-3.0-1-ov-file#GPL-3.0-1-ov-file\" rel=\"nofollow\">GPL-3.0 许可证</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><br>&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</p>\n<h5><br>超越限制，该模组旨在让<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">拔刀剑：重锋</span></a></strong>的性能更加卓越。</h5>\n<h5>但本模组所更改的内容均已提供配置文件，玩家可自行开启或关闭。</h5>\n<h5>目前提供的特性：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>提供索敌开关按键，关闭索敌后【潜行键】将不再进行索敌；</li>\n<li>更长的准星索敌距离，指哪锁哪；</li>\n<li>准星索敌辅瞄，再也不用担心锁不到人啦；</li>\n<li>更长的范围索敌，蜘蛛感应；</li>\n<li>可配置的索敌转视角速度；</li>\n<li>空中闪避；</li>\n<li>打断连招按键；</li>\n<li>可配置的缓降效果；</li>\n</ul>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">所有功能可通过服务端配置。</span></h5>\n<h5><strong>有想法或Bug，请：</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题反馈 · Arcomit/surpass</a></span></strong><br><strong>或</strong><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">合并请求 · Arcomit/surpass</a></strong></span></h5>\n<h5><strong>GitHub：</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcomit/surpass: 超越限制，重锋附属</a></span></strong><br><strong>许可证：</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/surpass?tab=GPL-3.0-1-ov-file#GPL-3.0-1-ov-file\" rel=\"nofollow\">GPL-3.0 许可证</a></span></strong></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>支持我们：</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fmewkooo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028108/description_ecd5707f-8a0d-4b69-b75b-ed3107aa150b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"217\"></strong></a></p>",
